{"seq":3,"slug":"columnar-storage","title":"列式存储与 OLAP 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/columnar-storage","wordCount":1507,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"列式存储与-olap-优化\">列式存储与 OLAP 优化</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>列式存储（Columnar Storage）是面向分析型查询（OLAP）场景的存储架构创新。与传统行式存储逐行组织数据不同，列式存储将同一列的所有值连续存放在一起。这种看似简单的组织方式变革，带来了压缩率、查询性能和向量化执行三个维度的量级提升。</p>\n<p>在数据仓库和实时分析领域，ClickHouse 单节点可在亚秒内扫描数十亿行、DuckDB 让笔记本电脑具备 TB 级分析能力——这些成就的基础都是列式存储架构。理解列式存储的设计决策，是构建高效数据分析系统的必备知识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"行式存储-vs-列式存储\">行式存储 vs 列式存储</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"行式存储 (Row-oriented):&#10;Row 1: [id=1, name=&quot;Alice&quot;, age=30, city=&quot;Beijing&quot;, salary=50000]&#10;Row 2: [id=2, name=&quot;Bob&quot;,   age=25, city=&quot;Shanghai&quot;, salary=45000]&#10;Row 3: [id=3, name=&quot;Carol&quot;, age=35, city=&quot;Beijing&quot;, salary=60000]&#10;&#10;列式存储 (Column-oriented):&#10;id:     [1, 2, 3, ...]&#10;name:   [&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;Carol&quot;, ...]&#10;age:    [30, 25, 35, ...]&#10;city:   [&quot;Beijing&quot;, &quot;Shanghai&quot;, &quot;Beijing&quot;, ...]&#10;salary: [50000, 45000, 60000, ...]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>行式存储 (Row-oriented):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Row 1: [id=1, name=\"Alice\", age=30, city=\"Beijing\", salary=50000]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Row 2: [id=2, name=\"Bob\",   age=25, city=\"Shanghai\", salary=45000]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Row 3: [id=3, name=\"Carol\", age=35, city=\"Beijing\", salary=60000]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>列式存储 (Column-oriented):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>id:     [1, 2, 3, ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name:   [\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Carol\", ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>age:    [30, 25, 35, ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>city:   [\"Beijing\", \"Shanghai\", \"Beijing\", ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>salary: [50000, 45000, 60000, ...]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>性能影响分析：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>行式存储</th>\n<th>列式存储</th>\n<th>分析场景优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I/O 量</td>\n<td>读取整行（含不需要的列）</td>\n<td>仅读取查询涉及的列</td>\n<td>列存减少 10-100x I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩率</td>\n<td>混合类型，压缩率低</td>\n<td>同类型数据，压缩率高</td>\n<td>列存 3-10x 更高压缩率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量化执行</td>\n<td>逐行处理，缓存不友好</td>\n<td>批量处理同类型数据</td>\n<td>列存 5-10x CPU 效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入效率</td>\n<td>追加一行简单高效</td>\n<td>需要写入多个列文件</td>\n<td>行存更适合事务写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点查询</td>\n<td>一次 I/O 获取完整行</td>\n<td>需要跨列组装</td>\n<td>行存更优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"列式压缩技术\">列式压缩技术</h3><p>同列数据具有相同类型和相似分布，使得高效压缩成为可能：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>压缩技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Run-Length Encoding (RLE)</td>\n<td>连续重复值存储为 (值, 次数)</td>\n<td>排序列、低基数列</td>\n<td>10-1000x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dictionary Encoding</td>\n<td>将值映射为整数字典 ID</td>\n<td>字符串列、枚举列</td>\n<td>5-20x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bit Packing</td>\n<td>用最少位数表示整数值</td>\n<td>小范围整数</td>\n<td>2-8x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delta Encoding</td>\n<td>存储相邻值的差值</td>\n<td>时间戳、自增 ID</td>\n<td>5-50x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frame of Reference (FOR)</td>\n<td>块内值减去最小值</td>\n<td>范围有限的数值</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LZ4 / ZSTD</td>\n<td>通用无损压缩</td>\n<td>通用后置压缩</td>\n<td>2-5x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>压缩示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原始数据 (city 列, 100万行):&#10;[&quot;Beijing&quot;, &quot;Shanghai&quot;, &quot;Beijing&quot;, &quot;Beijing&quot;, &quot;Guangzhou&quot;, ...]&#10;&#10;Step 1: 排序后 RLE&#10;[(&quot;Beijing&quot;, 450000), (&quot;Guangzhou&quot;, 150000), (&quot;Shanghai&quot;, 400000)]&#10;&#10;Step 2: Dictionary Encoding&#10;Dictionary: {0: &quot;Beijing&quot;, 1: &quot;Guangzhou&quot;, 2: &quot;Shanghai&quot;}&#10;Data: [0, 0, 0, ..., 1, 1, ..., 2, 2, ...]&#10;&#10;压缩前: 100万 × 平均8字节 = 8MB&#10;压缩后: 字典 30B + 位图 ≈ 125KB&#10;压缩比: 64x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原始数据 (city 列, 100万行):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[\"Beijing\", \"Shanghai\", \"Beijing\", \"Beijing\", \"Guangzhou\", ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 1: 排序后 RLE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[(\"Beijing\", 450000), (\"Guangzhou\", 150000), (\"Shanghai\", 400000)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 2: Dictionary Encoding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Dictionary: {0: \"Beijing\", 1: \"Guangzhou\", 2: \"Shanghai\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Data: [0, 0, 0, ..., 1, 1, ..., 2, 2, ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>压缩前: 100万 × 平均8字节 = 8MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>压缩后: 字典 30B + 位图 ≈ 125KB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>压缩比: 64x</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"向量化执行引擎\">向量化执行引擎</h3><p>列式存储天然适配向量化执行（Vectorized Execution），即一次操作处理一批同类型值而非逐行处理：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Column Chunk - 1024 values&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;SIMD Filter&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Vectorized Aggregate&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Result&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Column Chunk - 1024 values\"] --&gt; B[\"SIMD Filter\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Vectorized Aggregate\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Result\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 传统逐行执行 (Volcano Model)&#10;for each row in table:&#10;    if row.age &gt; 30:&#10;        sum += row.salary&#10;&#10;// 向量化执行 (Batch Processing)&#10;// 一次处理 1024 个值，充分利用 CPU SIMD 指令&#10;age_batch = load_column_chunk(&quot;age&quot;, offset, 1024)&#10;mask = simd_compare_gt(age_batch, 30)  // 一条指令比较 1024 个值&#10;salary_batch = load_column_chunk(&quot;salary&quot;, offset, 1024)&#10;sum += simd_masked_sum(salary_batch, mask)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 传统逐行执行 (Volcano Model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> each row in table:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row.salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 向量化执行 (Batch Processing)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 一次处理 1024 个值，充分利用 CPU SIMD 指令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age_batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> load_column_chunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> simd_compare_gt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(age_batch, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 一条指令比较 1024 个值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">salary_batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> load_column_chunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"salary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> simd_masked_sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary_batch, mask)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>向量化执行的性能优势来源：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>CPU Cache 友好</strong>：连续内存访问，L1/L2 缓存命中率高</li>\n<li><strong>SIMD 指令利用</strong>：AVX-512 一次处理 64 字节（16 个 int32）</li>\n<li><strong>分支预测友好</strong>：批量判断减少 CPU 分支预测失败</li>\n<li><strong>编译优化</strong>：编译器更容易对循环进行自动向量化</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"开放列式格式\">开放列式格式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>开发方</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>典型使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Apache Parquet</td>\n<td>Twitter/Cloudera</td>\n<td>嵌套数据支持好、生态广</td>\n<td>Spark, Hive, Presto</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache ORC</td>\n<td>Hortonworks</td>\n<td>轻量级索引、ACID 支持</td>\n<td>Hive, Presto</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Arrow</td>\n<td>Apache</td>\n<td>内存列式格式、零拷贝</td>\n<td>跨系统数据交换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lance</td>\n<td>LanceDB</td>\n<td>向量友好、版本化</td>\n<td>AI/ML 数据集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Parquet 文件结构：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"File:&#10;├── Row Group 1 (通常 128MB)&#10;│   ├── Column Chunk: id&#10;│   │   ├── Page 1 (Data Page, 压缩后)&#10;│   │   ├── Page 2&#10;│   │   └── Column Metadata&#10;│   ├── Column Chunk: name&#10;│   ├── Column Chunk: age&#10;│   └── ...&#10;├── Row Group 2&#10;│   └── ...&#10;└── Footer (Schema + Row Group Metadata + Column Statistics)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>File:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Row Group 1 (通常 128MB)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Column Chunk: id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── Page 1 (Data Page, 压缩后)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── Page 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── Column Metadata</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Column Chunk: name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Column Chunk: age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Row Group 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Footer (Schema + Row Group Metadata + Column Statistics)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"clickhouse-实践-mergetree-引擎\">ClickHouse 实践：MergeTree 引擎</h3><p>ClickHouse 的 MergeTree 引擎结合了 LSM-Tree 的写入模式和列式存储的查询优势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建分析表&#10;CREATE TABLE events (&#10;    event_date Date,&#10;    user_id    UInt64,&#10;    event_type LowCardinality(String),  -- 自动字典编码&#10;    properties String,&#10;    metric     Float64&#10;) ENGINE = MergeTree()&#10;PARTITION BY toYYYYMM(event_date)     -- 按月分区&#10;ORDER BY (event_type, user_id, event_date)  -- 排序键 (影响压缩和查询)&#10;SETTINGS index_granularity = 8192;     -- 稀疏索引粒度&#10;&#10;-- 典型分析查询：扫描数十亿行在亚秒完成&#10;SELECT&#10;    event_type,&#10;    count() AS cnt,&#10;    uniq(user_id) AS unique_users,&#10;    avg(metric) AS avg_metric&#10;FROM events&#10;WHERE event_date &gt;= &#39;2026-01-01&#39;&#10;  AND event_date &lt; &#39;2026-02-01&#39;&#10;GROUP BY event_type&#10;ORDER BY cnt DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建分析表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id    UInt64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_type LowCardinality(String),  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 自动字典编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    properties String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metric     Float64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MergeTree()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> toYYYYMM(event_date)     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按月分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event_type, user_id, event_date)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 排序键 (影响压缩和查询)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SETTINGS index_granularity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 稀疏索引粒度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 典型分析查询：扫描数十亿行在亚秒完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    uniq(user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unique_users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(metric) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_metric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-02-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"duckdb-实践-嵌入式-olap\">DuckDB 实践：嵌入式 OLAP</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import duckdb&#10;&#10;# DuckDB 直接查询 Parquet 文件（无需导入）&#10;con = duckdb.connect()&#10;&#10;# 查询 10GB Parquet 数据集&#10;result = con.execute(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    SELECT&#10;        l_returnflag,&#10;        l_linestatus,&#10;        sum(l_quantity) as sum_qty,&#10;        sum(l_extendedprice) as sum_base_price,&#10;        avg(l_discount) as avg_disc&#10;    FROM read_parquet(&#39;s3://bucket/lineitem/*.parquet&#39;)&#10;    WHERE l_shipdate &lt;= DATE &#39;2026-01-01&#39; - INTERVAL 90 DAY&#10;    GROUP BY l_returnflag, l_linestatus&#10;    ORDER BY l_returnflag, l_linestatus&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;).fetchdf()&#10;&#10;# 在笔记本电脑上 2-3 秒完成 (得益于列式扫描 + 向量化执行)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duckdb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># DuckDB 直接查询 Parquet 文件（无需导入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">con </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duckdb.connect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查询 10GB Parquet 数据集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> con.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        l_returnflag,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        l_linestatus,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        sum(l_quantity) as sum_qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        sum(l_extendedprice) as sum_base_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        avg(l_discount) as avg_disc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM read_parquet('s3://bucket/lineitem/*.parquet')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE l_shipdate &#x3C;= DATE '2026-01-01' - INTERVAL 90 DAY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY l_returnflag, l_linestatus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ORDER BY l_returnflag, l_linestatus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).fetchdf()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在笔记本电脑上 2-3 秒完成 (得益于列式扫描 + 向量化执行)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据建模-宽表-vs-星型模型\">数据建模：宽表 vs 星型模型</h3><p>列式存储改变了数据建模的最佳实践：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Star Schema - Traditional&quot;&#10;        F[&quot;Fact: sales&quot;] --&gt; D1[&quot;Dim: product&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; D2[&quot;Dim: customer&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; D3[&quot;Dim: time&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Wide Table - Columnar Optimized&quot;&#10;        W[&quot;Denormalized Wide Table: all columns in one table&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Star Schema - Traditional\"\n        F[\"Fact: sales\"] --&gt; D1[\"Dim: product\"]\n        F --&gt; D2[\"Dim: customer\"]\n        F --&gt; D3[\"Dim: time\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Wide Table - Columnar Optimized\"\n        W[\"Denormalized Wide Table: all columns in one table\"]\n    end</pre><p><strong>列式存储下的建模建议：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>预聚合宽表优于多表 JOIN（列存 JOIN 代价高）</li>\n<li>利用 Dictionary Encoding 容忍冗余字符串列</li>\n<li>按查询频率设计排序键（高频过滤列作为前缀）</li>\n<li>分区键选择时间列（便于数据生命周期管理）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"排序键选择策略\">排序键选择策略</h3><p>排序键（Sort Key / ORDER BY）是列式存储性能优化的核心杠杆：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>高频过滤列作为前缀</strong>：排序后相同值连续存放，RLE 压缩极高效</li>\n<li><strong>基数从低到高排列</strong>：低基数列排在前面，压缩效果最佳</li>\n<li><strong>考虑查询模式</strong>：如果 90% 查询按 <code>(tenant_id, date)</code> 过滤，则以此为排序键</li>\n<li><strong>避免高基数列作前缀</strong>：UUID 等高基数列会破坏压缩效果</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"分区策略\">分区策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按时间分区 (月/日)</td>\n<td>时序数据、日志</td>\n<td>最常用，便于 TTL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按租户分区</td>\n<td>多租户 SaaS</td>\n<td>避免分区过多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按哈希分区</td>\n<td>均匀分布的高基数键</td>\n<td>不支持范围裁剪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多级分区</td>\n<td>复合过滤条件</td>\n<td>复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"查询优化技巧\">查询优化技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>投影下推</strong>：只读取查询需要的列（列存天然支持）</li>\n<li><strong>谓词下推</strong>：过滤条件尽早执行，利用分区裁剪和稀疏索引</li>\n<li><strong>聚合下推</strong>：在存储层完成部分聚合，减少数据传输</li>\n<li><strong>物化视图</strong>：预计算高频聚合查询，用空间换时间</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>存储格式</th>\n<th>特色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ClickHouse</td>\n<td>OLAP 数据库</td>\n<td>MergeTree (自有列式)</td>\n<td>极致单节点性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DuckDB</td>\n<td>嵌入式 OLAP</td>\n<td>自有列式格式</td>\n<td>零配置分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Druid</td>\n<td>实时 OLAP</td>\n<td>Segment (列式)</td>\n<td>亚秒级实时摄入查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StarRocks</td>\n<td>MPP OLAP</td>\n<td>列式 + 向量化</td>\n<td>兼顾实时与离线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Databricks Photon</td>\n<td>查询引擎</td>\n<td>Delta Lake (Parquet)</td>\n<td>Spark 生态 C++ 向量化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Doris</td>\n<td>MPP OLAP</td>\n<td>列式存储</td>\n<td>简单易用的分析引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snowflake</td>\n<td>云数仓</td>\n<td>微分区列式</td>\n<td>存算分离、自动优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>列式存储通过三个核心机制实现 OLAP 场景的性能飞跃：列裁剪大幅减少 I/O、同类型压缩提升存储效率、向量化执行充分利用现代 CPU。在 2026 年的数据分析生态中，列式存储已从&quot;专用优化&quot;变为&quot;默认选择&quot;。</p>\n<p>关键设计决策包括：排序键的选择直接决定压缩率和查询性能；分区策略影响数据生命周期管理和裁剪效率；文件格式的选择（Parquet vs Arrow vs 专有格式）取决于数据交换需求和查询引擎集成度。工程师应当建立&quot;列思维&quot;——将每一列视为独立的压缩数据流，从列的视角思考数据组织与查询优化。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"列式存储与 OLAP 优化","id":"列式存储与-olap-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"行式存储 vs 列式存储","id":"行式存储-vs-列式存储"},{"level":3,"text":"列式压缩技术","id":"列式压缩技术"},{"level":3,"text":"向量化执行引擎","id":"向量化执行引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"开放列式格式","id":"开放列式格式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"ClickHouse 实践：MergeTree 引擎","id":"clickhouse-实践-mergetree-引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"DuckDB 实践：嵌入式 OLAP","id":"duckdb-实践-嵌入式-olap"},{"level":3,"text":"数据建模：宽表 vs 星型模型","id":"数据建模-宽表-vs-星型模型"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"排序键选择策略","id":"排序键选择策略"},{"level":3,"text":"分区策略","id":"分区策略"},{"level":3,"text":"查询优化技巧","id":"查询优化技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"索引结构与查询优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/index-structures"},"next":{"title":"主从复制与多主复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/replication-models"}}